@BeautySalonAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7244

### Lojas públicas
GET {{BeautySalonAPI_HostAddress}}/api/public/tenants
Accept: application/json

### Serviços de uma loja (público)
GET {{BeautySalonAPI_HostAddress}}/api/loja-centro/service
Accept: application/json

### Login
POST {{BeautySalonAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@exemplo.com", "password": "SUA_SENHA" }

### Estoque (exige token)
GET {{BeautySalonAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
